{
  "$comment": [
    "Machine and material profile seed data.",
    "",
    "These rows are COMMUNITY-SOURCED and are loaded with",
    "validation_status = 'unvalidated'. That is deliberate: the platform refuses",
    "to generate output for a machine profile that has not been bench-validated",
    "on real hardware, and nothing in a data file can honestly claim to have been.",
    "",
    "To promote a profile, an operator runs it, confirms the build volume, thermal",
    "limits, start/end G-code and speed ceilings against the real machine, then sets",
    "validation_status = 'validated' with validated_at/validated_by. A change to any",
    "value here creates a NEW profile_version; existing rows are never edited, so a",
    "previously generated job keeps referring to the profile it actually ran with.",
    "machine_restrictions.output_formats lists which file formats a machine may",
    "be offered for download: a format appears only when the profile declares it",
    "AND this deployment can actually produce it (default: gcode)."
  ],
